resource nic 'Microsoft.Network/networkInterfaces@2025-01-01' = {
  name: 'nic-app-01'
  location: location
  properties: {
    ipConfigurations: [
      {
        name: 'ipconfig1'
        properties: {
          subnet: {
            id: 'TODO'
          }
          privateIPAllocationMethod: 'Dynamic'
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

You need to reference the existing subnet without redeploying the virtual network.

Which change should you make?

